# inc-7wmu: measure Bloodspear Will before, during and after Magic Weapon.
# The sheet is the grant oracle; item descriptions prove boost start/end.
# Magic Weapon is persistent (-2): rest at depth 2 advances the day and
# removes it. Genocide prevents interrupted rest; depth 1 refuses sleeping.
# Acquisition and chargen follow bloodspear-orc-save.keys, seed 4.
# Description scrolling must reach Cost, below the outside-enchantment text.
# inc-frim: no chargen. The check loads the frozen orc barbarian
# tools/fixtures/chars/orc-barbarian-reapply-seed4.sav (INCURSION_LOAD), so
# the character no longer follows the seed.

d
@dump:orc-sheet-without-bloodspear
ESC

w
y
@choose "Wizard Mode Switches"
DOWN
SPACE                   # Auto-Identify Items
ESC

w
@choose "Item Acquisition"
RIGHT*10                # specific weapons
@until "Sword of the Planes" DOWN
ENTER
2                       # Bloodspear's INITIAL_PLUS
ENTER
b                       # Weapon Hand
SPACE
@while "two-handed" n
s                       # stow the displaced starting weapon
@dump:orc-wielded
ESC

d
@dump:orc-sheet-with-bloodspear
ESC

w
@choose "Item Acquisition"
RIGHT
@until "Scroll of Magic Weapon" DOWN
DOWN
ENTER
s
ESC
r
@choose "(in pack) Scroll of Magic Weapon"
@dump:read-target
a
@while "Stop reading?" n
@dump:cast
d
@dump:boosted-sheet
ESC
i
b
x
DOWN*100
@dump:boosted-item
ESC
ESC
w
@choose "Ascend / Descend Depth"
"2" ENTER
@while "Press [ENTER]" ENTER   # the arrival square decides whether "You fall..." waits here
@while "#------" SPACE         # ...and whether a level-description box (or "Splat.") opens
@until "HP:" ESC
w
@choose "Genocide Everything"
@until "HP:" ESC
z y
@dump:rested            # the wake message shows here, before any -- more --: a
                        # disguised monster's reveal ("you realize that this giant
                        # rat is really a plague rat!") can push it behind one
@while "-- more --" SPACE
d
@dump:expired-sheet
ESC
i
b
x
DOWN*100
@dump:expired-item
@quit
